# Records docs/deck.gif: `vhs docs/deck.tape` from the repo root, with
# tapes-test on PATH and a stack up. The README's GIF was recorded against
# a throwaway stack of made-up sessions, so it shows no one's real work.
Output docs/deck.gif
Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1500
Set Height 900
Set Padding 16
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Show
Type "tapes-test deck"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 4s
Down
Sleep 500ms
Down
Sleep 500ms
Down
Sleep 500ms
Down
Sleep 500ms
Down
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 3s
Down
Sleep 600ms
Down
Sleep 600ms
Down
Sleep 1.5s
Type "h"
Sleep 1.5s
Type "s"
Sleep 1.5s
Type "q"
Sleep 2s
